@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001

### Register — valide
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "d.franchet@gmail.com",
    "password": "Test1234!",
    "confirmPassword": "Test1234!"
}

###

### Register — email déjà utilisé
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "client@test.fr",
    "password": "Test1234!",
    "confirmPassword": "Test1234!"
}

###

### Register — mots de passe différents
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "autre@test.fr",
    "password": "Test1234!",
    "confirmPassword": "Mauvais!"
}

###

### Register — email invalide
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "pas-un-email",
    "password": "Test1234!",
    "confirmPassword": "Test1234!"
}

###

### Login — avant vérification email (doit échouer)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "client@test.fr",
    "password": "Test1234!"
}

###

### Login — mauvais mot de passe
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "client@test.fr",
    "password": "MauvaisMotDePasse!"
}

###

### Me — sans token (doit échouer)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me

###

### Logout — sans token (doit échouer)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout